  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Implementation and reproducible experiments for finite-path counterfactual
  certification under a specified bootstrap retraining law. The package includes
  exact-law Monte Carlo experiments, paired tabular path benchmarks, archived
  prediction banks, and independent robustness audits.
